#: ../../source/docs/modules/adsb.rst:3 f8a6edb9dd144e439e1f0eecf5b72077
msgid "ADS-B Tracking"
msgstr "ADS-B 跟踪"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/adsb.rst:9 a5e24a69fb6a4e1fb2f7dcfc13bb0b92
msgid ""
"The adsb module takes in any ADS-B data from the autopilot (via the "
"``ADSB_VEHICLE`` MAVLink message) and shows any nearby aircraft on the map. "
"It also warns if any aircraft get too close."
msgstr ""
"adsb 模块接收来自飞控的 ADS-B 数据（通过 ``ADSB_VEHICLE`` MAVLink "
"消息），并在地图上显示附近的航空器。同时，当有航空器过于接近时会发出警告。"

